  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.050" end="00:02.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:02.120" end="00:03.620" ttm:agent="v1">Hol' up</p>
      <p begin="00:03.460" end="00:04.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:04.400" end="00:06.390" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' baby, let me ask what your used to</p>
      <p begin="00:06.390" end="00:08.450" ttm:agent="v1">Got a couple things I could introduce you to</p>
      <p begin="00:08.450" end="00:10.280" ttm:agent="v1">I could show you a different type of lifestyle</p>
      <p begin="00:10.280" end="00:12.690" ttm:agent="v1">Make it worthwhile, lot of kids biting my style</p>
      <p begin="00:12.690" end="00:14.450" ttm:agent="v1">But it's all okay, I don't trip</p>
      <p begin="00:14.450" end="00:16.350" ttm:agent="v1">There's magic in this bottle, baby, come take a sip</p>
      <p begin="00:16.350" end="00:18.440" ttm:agent="v1">Said there's magic in this blunt, baby, come take a hit</p>
      <p begin="00:18.440" end="00:20.840" ttm:agent="v1">Said, I could show you how to fucking</p>
      <p begin="00:20.840" end="00:22.940" ttm:agent="v1">Two-step with a .22 in your waistband</p>
      <p begin="00:22.940" end="00:25.080" ttm:agent="v1">I just make money, baby, I don't really make friends</p>
      <p begin="00:25.080" end="00:27.140" ttm:agent="v1">Blunt by my bedframe for when the day ends</p>
      <p begin="00:27.140" end="00:29.510" ttm:agent="v1">Big bands in my left pocket where your right hand is</p>
      <p begin="00:29.510" end="00:31.670" ttm:agent="v1">We could get into some' if you want to</p>
      <p begin="00:31.670" end="00:33.420" ttm:agent="v1">You could rock with me if you want to</p>
      <p begin="00:33.420" end="00:35.220" ttm:agent="v1">But decide fast what you really, really want</p>
      <p begin="00:35.220" end="00:37.740" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause lately the kid's been really, really hot</p>
      <p begin="00:37.740" end="00:39.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Fuck you, Shady)</p>
      <p begin="00:38.960" end="00:40.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:39.570" end="00:41.690" ttm:agent="v1">Rock with me, bitch, I ain't no Mike Jack</p>
      <p begin="00:41.690" end="00:43.580" ttm:agent="v1">Your ex on your line, tell him, &quot;Don't call back&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:43.580" end="00:45.620" ttm:agent="v1">You my one and only, I could take you off the map</p>
      <p begin="00:45.620" end="00:47.420" ttm:agent="v1">Start a new life with me and don't look back</p>
      <p begin="00:47.420" end="00:49.380" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause, respectfully, you my bitch</p>
      <p begin="00:49.380" end="00:51.280" ttm:agent="v1">We don't got to prove, we up, gon' pass six</p>
      <p begin="00:51.280" end="00:53.300" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, we up on the score, they don't got to know we rich</p>
      <p begin="00:53.300" end="00:55.700" ttm:agent="v1">But I bet they know now from the thousand-dollar fits</p>
      <p begin="00:55.700" end="00:57.560" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm on ten, upping up my bank count</p>
      <p begin="00:57.560" end="00:59.930" ttm:agent="v1">Went from used whips to the double-R tang</p>
      <p begin="00:59.930" end="01:01.760" ttm:agent="v1">Ask me how I'm up, girl, I been in the paint</p>
      <p begin="01:01.760" end="01:03.920" ttm:agent="v1">Don't compare to your last girl I'm some' that he ain't</p>
      <p begin="01:03.920" end="01:05.420" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I'm done with it</p>
      <p begin="01:04.750" end="01:06.250" ttm:agent="v1">I'm in love with the guap</p>
      <p begin="01:06.050" end="01:07.990" ttm:agent="v1">But I could give you time you, see what you on about</p>
      <p begin="01:07.990" end="01:09.870" ttm:agent="v1">Don't need racks, to designer stores now</p>
      <p begin="01:09.870" end="01:11.370" ttm:agent="v1">I don't remember when the last time</p>
      <p begin="01:10.860" end="01:13.370" ttm:agent="v1">I checked my motherfucking bank account? Oh, wow</p>
      <p begin="01:13.370" end="01:15.260" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' baby, let me ask what your used to</p>
      <p begin="01:15.260" end="01:17.320" ttm:agent="v1">Got a couple things I could introduce you to</p>
      <p begin="01:17.320" end="01:19.220" ttm:agent="v1">I could show you a different type of lifestyle</p>
      <p begin="01:19.220" end="01:21.650" ttm:agent="v1">Make it worthwhile, lot of kids biting my style</p>
      <p begin="01:21.650" end="01:23.150" ttm:agent="v1">But it's all okay, I don't trip</p>
      <p begin="01:23.140" end="01:25.280" ttm:agent="v1">There's magic in this bottle, baby, come take a sip</p>
      <p begin="01:25.280" end="01:27.350" ttm:agent="v1">Said there's magic in this blunt, baby, come take a hit</p>
      <p begin="01:27.350" end="01:29.790" ttm:agent="v1">Said I could show you how to fucking</p>
      <p begin="01:29.790" end="01:31.820" ttm:agent="v1">Two-step with a .22 in your waistband</p>
      <p begin="01:31.820" end="01:33.980" ttm:agent="v1">I just make money, baby, I don't really make friends</p>
      <p begin="01:33.980" end="01:36.030" ttm:agent="v1">Blunt by my bedframe for when the day ends</p>
      <p begin="01:36.030" end="01:38.180" ttm:agent="v1">Big bands in my left pocket where your right hand is</p>
      <p begin="01:38.180" end="01:40.550" ttm:agent="v1">We could get into some' if you want to</p>
      <p begin="01:40.550" end="01:42.130" ttm:agent="v1">You could rock with me if you want to</p>
      <p begin="01:42.130" end="01:44.270" ttm:agent="v1">But decide fast what you really, really want</p>
      <p begin="01:44.270" end="01:46.970" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause lately the kid's been really, really hot</p>
      <p begin="01:46.970" end="01:51.350" ttm:agent="v1">I been waiting for the right time</p>
      <p begin="01:51.350" end="01:55.160" ttm:agent="v1">To put it back- for- a-all of my life</p>
      <p begin="01:55.160" end="01:59.560" ttm:agent="v1">I-I been waiting for the right time</p>
      <p begin="01:59.560" end="02:01.650" ttm:agent="v1">To put it back- for- a-all of my life</p>
